                    '2026-09-27,OKX,USDC,1000400000,1000400000,0,0,0,2\n2026-09-27,KuCoin,USDT,600000000,600000000,0,0,0,2\n2026-09-27,Bybit,ETH,1100,3300000,0,0,0,2\n'
